        "cellMapping": "For each independently inventoried row r and column c, source-r{r}-c{c} maps to object r{r}-c{c}, native r{r}-c{c}-inside-table, supplemental r{r}-c{c}-text-exact and r{r}-c{c}-cell-placement, and browser/SVG r{r}-c{c}-label.",
